# Morning flyers (Today 7am)

Date-keyed finished flyers in `config/morning_flyers.json` are the **main** Today look.

## Sacred Ground daily flyer template (Thursday-style)

Gold standard: `assets/sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-06-today-collage.png` (Founder-approved).

Use **versions of this layout system** — not an exact clone every day (stale), and **not** busy collage soup.

| Zone | Content |
|---|---|
| **Header** | `{WEEKDAY} AT` + `Sacred Ground` (gold script) + `Mind • Body • Spirit • Community` |
| **Left** | 1–3 stacked rounded **event cards** — icon + title + host + time + short keywords |
| **Right** | Evocative graphics aligned to those cards (clear zones, not overlapping clutter) |
| **Footer** | Circular logo + `shopsacredground.com` + `847-749-3922` + come-as-you-are energy |

- Dark elegant palette with gold accents (vary colors by day)
- Easy to read; separated event blocks win over freeform piles
- **No prices** ever on the graphic
- No invented practitioner faces — symbols/silhouettes OK; Tina circle only with approved refs
- `prebranded: true` → skip logo/TODAY/cream footer overlays

## Layout mix (required)

- **~75%** of new/future morning flyers → Thursday-style clear card layout (default)
- **~25%** may be artistic single-event hero layouts **IF still readable**
- Multi-event days → prefer Thursday-style cards
- `generate-morning-flyers` / `build_generation_prompt` defaults to Thursday-style

## Never put prices on flyers

- **Never** include `$`, dollar amounts, ticket costs, session fees, or “$55 / $99” style prices on morning flyer graphics.
- Do not bake `Event.cost` or TEC cost fields into flyer labels, overlays, or prompts.
- Captions may mention booking links; the **graphic** stays price-free.
- “FREE” for Free Community Meditation is OK (not a dollar amount).

## Facebook ≠ Instagram (date-keyed flyers)

- FB and IG must use **different full-day flyer visuals** (people who follow both should see variety).
- **Both platforms carry the same full-day information** (all main events; readable Thursday-style cards). Never an Eve-only / incomplete alt that drops events.
- Date keys support `url` (FB) + `url_instagram` (IG), or `urls: [fb, ig]` where **both** are complete full-day flyers.
- Selection: facebook → `url` / first; instagram → `url_instagram` / second; URLs must differ when both exist.
- If only one variant exists, temporarily share (with log) until the second is built — `generate-morning-flyers` prefers generating variant B.
- Aug 6 gold standard may remain single-URL (do not overwrite / do not force a second variant).

## Every day

- Every Chicago calendar day should have Thursday-style flyer variants (1–3 events max, or a warm visit-day flyer when empty).
- Prebuild: `python3 -m marketing generate-morning-flyers --days 7`
- Autopilot / 7am: ensure flyer for today exists before Today publish (see AUTOMATION-DRAFT.md / docs/MORNING-FLYERS.md).

## Do not

- Do not restore rejected atmospheric `sg-morning-creative-*` plates into rotation
- Do not overwrite a Founder-loved day’s flyer when redesigning other dates
- Do not overwrite the Aug 6 gold standard (`sg-morning-flyer-2026-08-06-today-collage.png`)
- Do not republish Aug 6 just to split FB/IG images
